
        /*** COPY THE JOBLOG TO PD01 WITH USER DATA AS MCABEND ***/

             PGM

             OVRPRTF    FILE(QPJOBLOG) OUTQ(PD01) USRDTA(MCABEND)
             MONMSG     MSGID(CPF0000)
             DSPJOBLOG  OUTPUT(*PRINT)
             MONMSG     MSGID(CPF0000)
             DLTOVR     FILE(QPJOBLOG)
             MONMSG     MSGID(CPF0000)

             ENDPGM
